# Flowstate App

AI-native social care product. Next.js + PostgreSQL on Vercel.

## Env

```
# Twilio
TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=
TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=
TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER=

# ElevenLabs
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID=

# Claude
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Database (Vercel Postgres)
POSTGRES_URL=

# Compliance framework — OPTIONAL. Default 'none' (regulator-agnostic).
# One of: none | cqc | care-inspectorate | ciw | rqia
FLOWSTATE_COMPLIANCE_FRAMEWORK=none

# Auth (set via Vercel / Auth.js)
AUTH_SECRET=
```
